; event verbs: everyday words for things increasing or decreasing.
; "flew away" = kshaya (departure/loss → subtraction)
; "came back" = vriddhi (arrival/gain → addition)
; 
; the pipeline walks:
; shabda "common-sense-events" verb → kshaya or vriddhi
; walk-in direction "kriya" → operation node (subtraction or addition)
; shabda operation "eval" → apply-op primitive ("sub" or "add")

(kosha common-sense-events
  (sthita common-sense-varga)
  (yukta kshaya vriddhi subtraction addition))
